From: e06cace23d09a39c309b748d36aa0c3c834eab48
Subject: [PATCH] netfilter: nft_payload: fix wrong mac header matching

上游 backport, 来自 mt6873-dev/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6885@cgroup-v2
原提交日期: 2023-10-08T17:36:53Z

原提交: https://github.com/mt6873-dev/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6885/commit/e06cace23d09a39c309b748d36aa0c3c834eab48

---
diff --git a/net/netfilter/nft_payload.c b/net/netfilter/nft_payload.c
--- a/net/netfilter/nft_payload.c
+++ b/net/netfilter/nft_payload.c
@@ -84,7 +84,7 @@ static void nft_payload_eval(const struct nft_expr *expr,
 
 	switch (priv->base) {
 	case NFT_PAYLOAD_LL_HEADER:
-		if (!skb_mac_header_was_set(skb))
+		if (!skb_mac_header_was_set(skb) || skb_mac_header_len(skb) == 0)
 			goto err;
 
 		if (skb_vlan_tag_present(skb)) {